-# Kuzatuv kartochkasi rasmining pastki o'ng burchagidagi dumaloq avatar
-# (iNaturalist uslubi) — rasmni KIM joylaganini bildiradi. Umumiy partial:
-# profil sahifasi (_plant_sighting) va tur sahifasi (plants/show galereya)
-# bir xil ko'rinsin. Avatar ALOHIDA <a> (profil havolasi) — chaqiruvchi
-# uni kuzatuv havolasi (`<a>`) ICHIGA joylashtirmasligi kerak (ichma-ich
-# `<a>` HTML'да yaroqsiz); shuning uchun `.sighting-photo-wrap`
-# (position:relative) konteyner ichida rasm havolasi bilan YONMA-YON
-# turadi.
-#
-# `user[:avatar]` (xom ustun) tekshiriladi, `user.avatar.present?` EMAS:
-# ikkinchisi Fog (R2) bilan har chaqirilganда tarmoq so'rovi yuboradi
-# (galereyada o'nlab kartochka — o'nlab keraksiz so'rov).
- user = sighting.user
- if user
  - name = user.full_name
  - if user[:avatar].present?
    = link_to profile_path(user), class: 'sighting-user-avatar', title: name, 'aria-label' => name do
      = image_tag user.avatar.url, alt: name, class: 'sighting-user-avatar-img'
  - else
    - initials = "#{user.first_name.to_s.first}#{user.last_name.to_s.first}".upcase
    = link_to profile_path(user), class: 'sighting-user-avatar sighting-user-avatar--initials', title: name, 'aria-label' => name do
      %span= initials
